---
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<aside
  class="my-12 rounded-xl border border-accent-light bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-light/20 to-seasalt p-6 md:p-8"
  aria-label="Community invite"
>
  <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Sell While You Sleep</p>
  <h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-xl text-primary md:text-2xl">
    Want this run past 5,000+ coaches?
  </h3>
  <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-jet/90">
    The free Skool community is where coaches drop drafts, ad copy, and offer ideas to get
    feedback from people who have already built it. Reads in two minutes, answers in two days.
  </p>
  <a
    href={SITE.social.skool}
    class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-seasalt transition-colors hover:bg-secondary"
  >
    Join the free community
    <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
  </a>
</aside>
